    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.poster.avif?t=1751571087\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.webm?t=1751571087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.mp4?t=1751571087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and Develop Land</strong>: Increase the value of your land by developing profitable projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Homes and Buildings</strong>: Bring your dream projects to life, from modern homes to massive commercial structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase Vehicles and Equipment</strong>: Acquire the tools and machinery you need to optimize your construction tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Simulation</strong>: Manage your budget carefully, reduce costs, and make strategic decisions to maximize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Management</strong>: Organize your workforce, meet client demands, and become a successful CEO.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Can You Do?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in land and generate great returns through smart moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your clients' trust by completing projects on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpace your competitors with city-enhancing projects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contractor Simulator</strong> transforms real-world construction and management processes into a fun simulation experience, appealing to construction enthusiasts and strategy game lovers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and start writing your story in the construction world!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.poster.avif?t=1751571087\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.webm?t=1751571087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447580/extras/2e4e8006ae3afd6606b3235df990566d.mp4?t=1751571087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and Develop Land</strong>: Increase the value of your land by developing profitable projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Homes and Buildings</strong>: Bring your dream projects to life, from modern homes to massive commercial structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase Vehicles and Equipment</strong>: Acquire the tools and machinery you need to optimize your construction tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Simulation</strong>: Manage your budget carefully, reduce costs, and make strategic decisions to maximize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Management</strong>: Organize your workforce, meet client demands, and become a successful CEO.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Can You Do?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in land and generate great returns through smart moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your clients' trust by completing projects on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpace your competitors with city-enhancing projects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contractor Simulator</strong> transforms real-world construction and management processes into a fun simulation experience, appealing to construction enthusiasts and strategy game lovers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist now and start writing your story in the construction world!</strong></p>",
